{"id": "16-1687-2-2", "zh": "以 h 结尾的词根", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1688-2-4", "zh": "hā，舍弃义。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1688-5-8", "zh": "jahati，vijahati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1688-9-18", "zh": "vijahanaṃ，jahituṃ，jahātave，jahitvā，jahāya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1689-2-4", "zh": "mhī，微笑义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1689-5-9", "zh": "mhayate，umhayate，vimhayate。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1690-2-7", "zh": "其中，**mhayate** 是指露出微笑。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1690-8-12", "zh": "**umhayate** 是指显出欢喜的样子。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1690-13-17", "zh": "**vimhayate** 是指感到惊奇。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1690-18-26", "zh": "这里有这样的经文：“看见他，也不对他露出欢喜的笑容，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1690-27-30", "zh": "也不用目光和微笑示意，", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-1690-31-34", "zh": "总是先含笑然后才说话。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1690-35-41", "zh": "当公主带着欢喜的笑容望向我时，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1690-42-44", "zh": "钵婆婆帝会使人欢笑，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1690-45-50", "zh": "钵婆婆帝会使人开怀大笑。”", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1691-2-8", "zh": "其中，**umhayamānā** 是指显出欢喜的样子而笑着。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1691-9-13", "zh": "**umhāpeyyā** 是指以微笑的方式使人欢喜。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1691-14-18", "zh": "**pamhāpeyyā** 是指以大笑的方式逗人发笑。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1692-2-4", "zh": "hu，施与义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1692-5-6", "zh": "havati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1692-7-8", "zh": "huti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1693-2-4", "zh": "hu，供祭义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1693-5-8", "zh": "供祭，就是以特定的方式备办供品的行为。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-1693-9-10", "zh": "havati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1693-11-18", "zh": "huto，hutavā，hutāvī，āhuti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1694-2-4", "zh": "hū，存在义。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1694-5-8", "zh": "hoti，honti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1694-9-12", "zh": "hosi，hotha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1694-13-16", "zh": "homi，homa。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1694-17-20", "zh": "pahoti，pahonti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1694-21-29", "zh": "pahūtaṃ，pahūtā，例如“kuto pahūtā kalahā vivādā”（争吵与争论从何而生）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1694-30-37", "zh": "honto，hontā，hontaṃ，pahonto。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1694-38-40", "zh": "pacchāsamaṇena hotabbaṃ（应当有一位随行沙门）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1694-41-47", "zh": "hotuṃ，hotuye，pahotuṃ，hutvāna。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1694-48-49", "zh": "以上是现在时语尾等的形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1694-50-53", "zh": "这里只收取了常见的形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1695-2-5", "zh": "hotu，hontu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1695-6-9", "zh": "hosi，hotha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1695-10-13", "zh": "homi，homa。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1695-14-15", "zh": "以上是命令语气（第五语尾）的形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1695-16-19", "zh": "这里也只收取了常见的形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1696-2-5", "zh": "huveyya，huveyyuṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1696-6-9", "zh": "huveyyāsi，huveyyātha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1696-10-13", "zh": "huveyyāmi，huveyyāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1696-14-17", "zh": "huvetha，huveraṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1696-18-21", "zh": "huvetho，huveyyāvho。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1696-22-25", "zh": "huveyyaṃ，huveyyāmhe。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1696-26-28", "zh": "以上是祈愿语气（第七语尾）的形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1696-29-63", "zh": "不过，因为在经文“活命外道优波迦说了‘但愿如此吧，朋友’，摇了摇头，走上岔路离开了”中见到 **huveyyā** 这个词，所以依此类推，列出了“huveyya，huveyyuṃ”等形式。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1696-64-71", "zh": "也可见到 hupeyya 这种读法，如同 paccapekkhaṇā 那样。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "16-1696-72-79", "zh": "据此，“hupeyya，hupeyyuṃ，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1696-80-90", "zh": "hupeyyāsi”等由 v 音替换为 p 音而成的形式也应当收取。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1697-2-8", "zh": "另一种方式：heyya，heyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1697-9-12", "zh": "heyyāsi，heyyātha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1697-13-16", "zh": "heyyāmi，heyyāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1697-17-20", "zh": "hetha，heraṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1697-21-24", "zh": "hetho，heyyāvho。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1697-25-28", "zh": "heyyaṃ，heyyāmhe。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1697-29-32", "zh": "这些是依照义注的用法收取的形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1697-33-41", "zh": "这里，“生起本身并不生起，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1697-42-54", "zh": "如果它会生起，那么生起也就会有生起了”这句话，也应当看作一个例证。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1698-2-5", "zh": "huva，huvu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1698-6-9", "zh": "huve，huvittha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1698-10-13", "zh": "huvaṃ，huvimha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1698-14-21", "zh": "huvittha，也作 hotha，是由复辅音中省略 t 音而成，意思是 ahosi（曾经是）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1698-22-44", "zh": "正因如此，解释“kasirā jīvikā hotha”这句意思的人说，它的意思是“我们的生活曾经很艰难”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1698-45-46", "zh": "huvire。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1698-47-50", "zh": "huvittho，huvivdo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1698-51-54", "zh": "huviṃ，huvimhe。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1698-55-57", "zh": "以上是远过去时语尾的形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1699-2-5", "zh": "ahuvā，ahuvū。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1699-6-9", "zh": "ahuvo，ahuvattha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1699-10-13", "zh": "ahuvaṃ，ahuvamha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1699-14-17", "zh": "ahuvattha，ahuvatthuṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1699-18-21", "zh": "ahuvase，ahuvavhaṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1699-22-25", "zh": "ahuviṃ，ahuvamhase。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-1699-26-27", "zh": "以上是昨天过去时语尾的形式。", "confidence": 75}
